+-            "text": "{\"multi\":true,\"response\":{\"rl-briefs-store\":{\"data\":[{\"attachments\":[],\"authors\":[\"Research Team\"],\"body\":\"# Executive Summary\\n\\nThis research brief examines momentum factor performance in the technology sector during Q4 2025. We analyze:\\n\\n## Key Findings\\n\\n1. **Momentum Persistence**: Tech stocks with strong 3-month momentum show 65% probability of continuing outperformance\\n2. **Volatility Patterns**: High-momentum stocks exhibit 23% higher volatility but generate superior risk-adjusted returns\\n3. **Sector Rotation**: Evidence of rotation from mega-cap to mid-cap tech names\\n\\n## Methodology\\n\\n- Universe: Top 500 technology stocks by market capitalization\\n- Period: January 2024 - November 2025\\n- Factors: Price momentum (1M, 3M, 6M), relative strength, volume trends\\n\\n## Sample Tickers\\n\\nTop momentum candidates: NVDA, AMD, AVGO, AAPL, MSFT, GOOGL\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n\\n1. Run comprehensive screening on full universe\\n2. Backtest strategy over 5-year period\\n3. Evaluate portfolio construction methodologies\\n4. Assess transaction cost impact\",\"created_at\":\"2025-11-15T10:30:00Z\",\"id\":\"demo_brief_001\",\"last_updated\":\"2025-11-18T14:20:00Z\",\"notes\":\"\",\"summary\":\"Analysis of momentum factors in the technology sector focusing on Q4 2025 performance drivers. This research brief explores the relationship between short-term price momentum and fundamental strength in high-growth technology stocks.\",\"tags\":[\"momentum\",\"tech\",\"quantitative\"],\"title\":\"Momentum Factor Research: Tech Sector Q4 2025\"}]},\"rl-alert\":{\"children\":\"\",\"color\":\"info\",\"is_open\":false}}}"
